 "Agente {0} registrado.": "Agent {0} registered.",
 "Copia esta api key ahora -- no se va a volver a mostrar (pegala en la variable": "Copy this API key now -- it will not be shown again (paste it into the variable",
 "al configurar remote-agent/agent.py en la maquina donde va a correr el agente):": "when configuring remote-agent/agent.py on the machine where the agent will run):",
 "Ya la copie": "I already copied it",
 "Registrado por": "Registered by",
 "Api key": "API key",
 "nunca (todavia no hizo polling)": "never (has not polled yet)",
 "Este agente se crea automaticamente al iniciar el servicio y no se puede eliminar para que los escaneres siempre funcionen.": "This agent is created automatically when the service starts and cannot be deleted so that the scanners always work.",
