 "para escanear tu red real (192.168.x.x, etc.) necesitas tenerlo corriendo en una PC con visibilidad a esa red. Doble-clic en": "to scan your real network (192.168.x.x, etc.) you need to have it running on a PC with visibility into that network. Double-click",
 "en esa PC (una sola vez, no hace falta ser administrador) y queda andando solo de ahi en adelante, incluso despues de reiniciar Windows.": "on that PC (just once, administrator rights are not required) and from then on it keeps running on its own, even after restarting Windows.",
 "No se pudo eliminar el agente.": "Could not delete the agent.",
 "Escaneos remotos": "Remote scans",
 "Elegi el scanner (nuclei, zap, semgrep, gitleaks, zeek o falco), el agente y el target. El agente elegido se lleva el job en su siguiente polling y manda el resultado solo -- puede tardar unos segundos segun su intervalo de polling. Cada scanner necesita su binario instalado en la maquina del agente; si falta, el job vuelve con un error claro. Para lanzar tenes que pegar la api key del agente (la que te mostro al registrarlo): se valida contra ese agente antes de crear el escaneo.": "Choose the scanner (nuclei, zap, semgrep, gitleaks, zeek or falco), the agent and the target. The chosen agent picks up the job on its next poll and sends the result on its own -- it can take a few seconds depending on its polling interval. Each scanner needs its binary installed on the agent's machine; if it is missing, the job comes back with a clear error. To launch you must paste the agent's API key (the one shown when you registered it): it is validated against that agent before the scan is created.",
