 "Agregar dominio a monitorear": "Add domain to monitor",
 "Registra un dominio propio (ej. \"empresa.com\"). TERO Security descubre subdominios expuestos publicamente via logs de Certificate Transparency (crt.sh) y chequea periodicamente el certificado SSL que cada uno esta sirviendo -- nunca hace un escaneo activo de puertos ni toca infraestructura de terceros.": "Register a domain you own (e.g. \"company.com\"). TERO Security discovers publicly exposed subdomains via Certificate Transparency logs (crt.sh) and periodically checks the SSL certificate each one is serving -- it never performs an active port scan or touches third-party infrastructure.",
