 "Gobernanza de IA en el codigo": "AI governance in code",
 "Quien escribio cada cambio (persona o IA), si paso la revision y la compuerta de seguridad, y un registro firmado que nadie puede alterar sin que se note": "Who wrote each change (person or AI), whether it passed review and the security gate, and a signed log that nobody can alter without it showing",
 "Compuerta de seguridad": "Security gate",
 "Cada cambio se revisa solo, antes de darlo por bueno: busca secretos, patrones inseguros (eval, shell=True, SQL armado con texto, TLS desactivado...), verifica si el codigo con IA tiene la revision humana que pide la politica, y decide:": "Each change is checked automatically before it is accepted: it looks for secrets and insecure patterns (eval, shell=True, SQL built from strings, TLS disabled...), verifies that AI-written code has the human review the policy requires, and decides:",
 "Aprobado": "Approved",
 "Bloqueado": "Blocked",
 "Hubiera bloqueado": "Would have blocked",
 "(politica en modo Exigir) o": "(policy in Enforce mode) or",
 "(modo Observar: avisa pero deja pasar). Se evalua al escanear un repositorio, al revisar o declarar un cambio, y cuando tu pipeline de CI lo consulta.": "(Observe mode: warns but lets it through). It is evaluated when a repository is scanned, when a change is reviewed or declared, and when your CI pipeline queries it.",
 "Ultimas evaluaciones": "Latest evaluations",
 "Todos los resultados": "All results",
 "Todavia no hay evaluaciones.": "There are no evaluations yet.",
 "Commit": "Commit",
 "Resultado": "Result",
 "Politica": "Policy",
 "Disparada por": "Triggered by",
 "Motivos": "Reasons",
 "Conectar la compuerta a tu pipeline (GitHub Actions)": "Connect the gate to your pipeline (GitHub Actions)",
 "Con este paso, un pull request que no pasa la compuerta (en modo Exigir) hace fallar el pipeline y no se puede integrar. Guarda en GitHub un secreto llamado": "With this step, a pull request that does not pass the gate (in Enforce mode) fails the pipeline and cannot be merged. Save a secret in GitHub named",
 "con un token de acceso de TERO (usuario con rol analyst o superior). Si el servidor de TERO no es accesible desde GitHub, usa un runner propio.": "with a TERO access token (a user with the analyst role or higher). If the TERO server is not reachable from GitHub, use a self-hosted runner.",
 "Guardalo como": "Save it as",
 "en el repositorio. Si el repositorio no esta conectado en TERO, la consulta responde que no lo encuentra.": "in the repository. If the repository is not connected in TERO, the query answers that it cannot find it.",
 "Todo lo que importa queda anotado aca: cada cambio registrado, cada declaracion de origen, cada revision, cada evaluacion de la compuerta y cada cambio de politica. Las entradas se encadenan (cada una guarda la huella de la anterior) y se firman con una clave que no esta en la base de datos: nadie puede editar ni borrar el pasado sin que la verificacion lo detecte. Solo se agrega, nunca se modifica.": "Everything that matters is recorded here: every registered change, every origin declaration, every review, every gate evaluation and every policy change. Entries are chained (each one stores the fingerprint of the previous one) and signed with a key that is not in the database: nobody can edit or delete the past without verification detecting it. It is append-only and never modified.",
 "Descargar JSON (verificable)": "Download JSON (verifiable)",
 "Descargar CSV": "Download CSV",
 "Registro integro.": "Log intact.",
 "{0} entradas, encadenadas y firmadas correctamente.": "{0} entries, correctly chained and signed.",
 "Huella final:": "Final fingerprint:",
 "El registro fue alterado.": "The log was tampered with.",
 "Primera entrada con problema: #{0}.": "First entry with a problem: #{0}.",
 "Ancla externa": "External anchor",
 "Si alguien con acceso a la base borrara las ultimas entradas, desde adentro no se nota. Para cubrir eso, genera un ancla (cantidad de entradas y huella final) y guardala por fuera de TERO: en un mail, un ticket o una carpeta aparte. Despues podes verificar el registro contra esa ancla.": "If someone with database access deleted the latest entries, it would not be noticeable from the inside. To cover that, generate an anchor (number of entries and final fingerprint) and store it outside TERO: in an email, a ticket or a separate folder. Later you can verify the log against that anchor.",
