 "Quien escribio cada cambio": "Who wrote each change",
 "Cada commit de tus repositorios queda registrado con su autor, si lo escribio una persona, una IA o ambas, la herramienta y el modelo, cuantas lineas toco y que hallazgos tiene. Es el contador de modificaciones de codigo.": "Every commit in your repositories is recorded with its author, whether a person, an AI or both wrote it, the tool and the model, how many lines it touched and which findings it has. It is the code modification counter.",
 "Cualquier origen": "Any origin",
 "Mixto": "Mixed",
 "Cualquier resultado de la compuerta": "Any gate result",
 "TERO reconoce solo las marcas que dejan Claude, Copilot, Cursor, Aider y otras (lineas Co-Authored-By). Para marcar a mano, agrega estas lineas al final del mensaje del commit:": "TERO only recognizes the marks left by Claude, Copilot, Cursor, Aider and others (Co-Authored-By lines). To mark by hand, add these lines at the end of the commit message:",
