 "sin informar": "not reporting",
 "Como activar el modo aislado": "How to turn on isolated mode",
 "En la carpeta de TERO, en una terminal. Desde ese momento ningun servicio puede hablar con internet, y la prueba de arriba lo confirma. Se vuelve al modo normal con el mismo comando sin el archivo de aislado. Dejan de funcionar a proposito las consultas a NVD, CISA KEV, AbuseIPDB, crt.sh, GitHub, el SSO externo y los avisos en la nube; lo local sigue igual.": "In the TERO folder, in a terminal. From then on no service can talk to the internet, and the test above confirms it. You go back to normal mode with the same command without the isolated file. Queries to NVD, CISA KEV, AbuseIPDB, crt.sh, GitHub, external SSO and cloud notifications deliberately stop working; everything local stays the same.",
 "Limites de esta prueba": "Limits of this proof",
 "Aislado y verificado": "Isolated and verified",
 "Todos los servicios estan en modo aislado y la prueba de red no pudo salir a internet.": "All services are in isolated mode and the network test could not reach the internet.",
 "Aislado por la aplicacion, falta confirmar la red": "Isolated by the application, network still to be confirmed",
 "Todos los servicios bloquean las salidas, pero la red todavia no demostro que no se pueda salir.": "All services block outbound traffic, but the network has not yet proven that leaving is impossible.",
 "Con salidas controladas": "With controlled outbound traffic",
 "TERO habla con internet solo con destinos conocidos. Abajo ves cuales, para que y que datos viajan.": "TERO talks to the internet only with known destinations. Below you can see which ones, why and what data is sent.",
 "Hay salidas no catalogadas": "There is uncatalogued outbound traffic",
 "Algun servicio hablo con un destino externo que no esta en el catalogo. Revisalo primero.": "A service talked to an external destination that is not in the catalog. Review it first.",
 "Todavia sin datos": "No data yet",
 "Los servicios informan cada minuto; si despues de unos minutos sigue vacio, revisa que case-service este activo.": "Services report every minute; if it is still empty after a few minutes, check that case-service is running.",
 "Conocido": "Known",
 "Configurado por un administrador": "Configured by an administrator",
 "No catalogado": "Not catalogued",
 "Hay salidas a destinos que no estan catalogados: revisalos en la tabla.": "There is outbound traffic to destinations that are not catalogued: review them in the table.",
 "Falta la prueba de red.": "The network test is missing.",
 "La prueba de red logro salir a internet: el modo aislado de la aplicacion no alcanza, falta aislar la red.": "The network test managed to reach the internet: the application's isolated mode is not enough, the network must be isolated too.",
 "El modo aislado esta activo solo en algunos servicios.": "Isolated mode is active in only some services.",
 "Sin informes recientes de: {0}.": "No recent reports from: {0}.",
 "El aislamiento de red no cubre {0} (necesita llegar a tu red local); alli rige solo el modo aislado de la aplicacion.": "Network isolation does not cover {0} (it needs to reach your local network); there only the application's isolated mode applies.",
 "Solo se ve lo que sale por la aplicacion (HTTP, SMTP, AWS, git). Programas externos que un servicio lance como proceso (trivy, nuclei) no se miden desde adentro: por eso la prueba de red es la que manda.": "Only what leaves through the application is seen (HTTP, SMTP, AWS, git). External programs that a service launches as a process (trivy, nuclei) are not measured from the inside: that is why the network test is what counts.",
 "La prueba de red se hace desde el contenedor de case-service; si otros servicios estan en redes distintas, probalos aparte.": "The network test is run from the case-service container; if other services are on different networks, test them separately.",
 "El atestado prueba lo que TERO observo hasta el momento de firmarlo, no lo que ocurra despues.": "The attestation proves what TERO observed up to the moment it was signed, not what happens afterwards.",
