 "Prueba de salida a internet": "Internet access test",
 "Atestado de soberania firmado": "Signed sovereignty attestation",
 "Cierre verificado de vulnerabilidades": "Verified vulnerability closure",
 "Marcar una vulnerabilidad como remediada es solo una declaracion. Aca TERO repite el mismo escaneo que la encontro y solo la da por cerrada si ya no aparece. Si sigue ahi, la reabre sola. Cada resultado queda firmado en la cadena de custodia y se puede bajar como prueba. El tiempo de cierre real se mide hasta la verificacion, no hasta que alguien dijo que estaba lista.": "Marking a vulnerability as remediated is just a statement. Here TERO repeats the same scan that found it and only treats it as closed if it no longer shows up. If it is still there, TERO reopens it by itself. Every result is signed in the chain of custody and can be downloaded as proof. The real closing time is measured up to the verification, not up to when someone said it was done.",
 "Cierres verificados": "Verified closures",
 "Cierres que fallaron": "Failed closures",
 "En verificacion": "Being verified",
 "Remediadas sin verificar": "Remediated, not verified",
 "Tiempo de cierre declarado": "Declared closing time",
 "Tiempo de cierre real": "Real closing time",
 "Cierres falsos": "False closures",
 "Verificadas": "Verified",
 "Fallaron": "Failed",
 "Sin verificar": "Not verified",
 "Tiempo declarado": "Declared time",
