 "Vulnerabilidades remediadas": "Remediated vulnerabilities",
 "Todavia no hay vulnerabilidades remediadas. Al marcar una como remediada en Vulnerabilidades, la verificacion empieza sola.": "There are no remediated vulnerabilities yet. When you mark one as remediated in Vulnerabilities, verification starts by itself.",
 "Vulnerabilidad": "Vulnerability",
 "Cierre": "Closure",
 "Volver a verificar": "Verify again",
 "Verificar ahora": "Verify now",
 "Descargar prueba": "Download proof",
 "Que significa cada estado": "What each status means",
 "Verificado:": "Verified:",
 "el escaneo repetido (mismo escaner, objetivo y opciones) termino y ya no detecta la vulnerabilidad.": "the repeated scan (same scanner, target and options) finished and no longer detects the vulnerability.",
 "Cierre fallido (reabierta):": "Failed closure (reopened):",
 "el escaneo repetido la volvio a detectar; TERO la reabrio y lo anoto en la cadena.": "the repeated scan detected it again; TERO reopened it and recorded it in the chain.",
 "Sin concluir:": "Inconclusive:",
 "el escaneo fallo o no termino a tiempo. Nunca se da por verificada sin un escaneo completo; podes reintentar.": "the scan failed or did not finish in time. It is never treated as verified without a complete scan; you can retry.",
 "No verificable:": "Not verifiable:",
 "el hallazgo no viene de un escaneo que se pueda repetir (archivos subidos, agente remoto, nube, superficie de ataque, codigo).": "the finding does not come from a scan that can be repeated (uploaded files, remote agent, cloud, attack surface, code).",
 "Limite: verificado quiere decir que el escaneo repetido ya no la detecta. Si el objetivo estaba apagado y el escaner termino sin informar un error, podria dar un falso verificado; por eso el detalle muestra cuantos hallazgos tuvo el re-escaneo.": "Limit: verified means the repeated scan no longer detects it. If the target was powered off and the scanner finished without reporting an error, it could give a false verified; that is why the detail shows how many findings the re-scan had.",
 "Cierre fallido (reabierta)": "Failed closure (reopened)",
 "Sin concluir": "Inconclusive",
 "No verificable": "Not verifiable",
 "Verificado": "Verified",
