 "el escaneo original ya no existe (o fue de un agente remoto), no se puede repetir": "the original scan no longer exists (or came from a remote agent), it cannot be repeated",
 "el hallazgo viene de un archivo subido: hay que volver a subirlo": "the finding comes from an uploaded file: it has to be uploaded again",
 "este tipo de escaner no permite repetir el escaneo para comprobar un cierre": "this type of scanner cannot repeat the scan to check a closure",
 "No se pudo pedir el re-escaneo ({0}). Podes reintentar a mano.": "The re-scan could not be requested ({0}). You can retry by hand.",
