 "El re-escaneo no termino en {0} horas. Podes reintentar.": "The re-scan did not finish in {0} hours. You can retry.",
 "El re-escaneo no se completo ({0}). No se da por verificada.": "The re-scan did not complete ({0}). It is not treated as verified.",
 "El re-escaneo no se completo ({0}): {1}. No se da por verificada.": "The re-scan did not complete ({0}): {1}. It is not treated as verified.",
 "El re-escaneo la volvio a detectar ({0} coincidencia/s): el cierre no se sostiene.": "The re-scan detected it again ({0} match(es)): the closure does not hold.",
 "El re-escaneo termino sin esta vulnerabilidad ({0} hallazgos en total).": "The re-scan finished without this vulnerability ({0} findings in total).",
 "Cumplimiento": "Compliance",
 "Cumplimiento con evidencia viva": "Compliance with live evidence",
 "Ley 25.326 de Proteccion de los Datos Personales, medidas recomendadas por la Res. AAIP 47/2018 y los puntos que pide un seguro de ciberseguridad. Cada control se comprueba con datos reales de TERO (usuarios con MFA, escaneos, vulnerabilidades abiertas...) y lo que TERO no puede ver lo declara una persona, con nota, fecha y vencimiento. Lo verificado y lo declarado nunca se mezclan sin decirlo.": "Law 25.326 on Personal Data Protection, the measures recommended by Res. AAIP 47/2018 and the points a cybersecurity insurance asks for. Each control is checked with real TERO data (users with MFA, scans, open vulnerabilities...) and what TERO cannot see is declared by a person, with a note, a date and an expiry. What is verified and what is declared are never mixed without saying so.",
 "Verificado por TERO": "Verified by TERO",
